Andamio Desktop

This product includes software adapted from credential-badges
(https://github.com/Andamio-Platform/credential-badges), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. The badge renderer (src/badge/render.ts) and the
badge palettes (src/badge/palettes.ts) are TypeScript ports of
generator/gen.py and generator/colors.py from that project. Changes: the OB3
metadata blocks and the ASCII title sanitizer were left out, and the plate
labels were renamed for collections and credentials.

Some built-in badges draw on coach (https://github.com/Andamio-Platform/coach),
licensed under the MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Andamio. "Tighten a learning
target" and "Run a Nostr relay" are ported from its knowledge files. "Split or
keep an "and"", "Review a set of learning targets", "Draft targets and an
assignment for a module", "Pick a lesson type" and "Set a relay's moderation
policy" are new badges written on its skills and knowledge files
(src/collections/).

src/badge/fonts.css is copied from credential-badges generator/fonts.css. It
embeds subsets of these fonts, each licensed under the SIL Open Font License,
Version 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org):

- Archivo, Copyright The Archivo Project Authors
- Spline Sans Mono, Copyright The Spline Sans Mono Project Authors
